  "title": "SC Upholds Quashing of Yes Bank's AT-1 Bond Write-Off Amid Dispute",
  "summary": "The Supreme Court upheld the Bombay High Court's decision to quash Yes Bank's ₹8,415-crore AT-1 bond write-off, ruling that the administrator lacked the legal authority. This ruling led to the partial cancellation of the bond write-off, which affected Yes Bank's financial stability.",
